# TechTonic V2.0 Product Rules

## Communication

- Reply in Vietnamese unless the user requests another language.
- Read existing code before editing; match Next.js App Router, Tailwind, shadcn/Radix, Framer Motion patterns.

## Design

- Cyber-futuristic, premium dark mode, glassmorphism.
- Accent palette: neon cyan, purple, magenta, electric blue.
- Mobile-first, semantic HTML, accessible interactions.

## Content

- Official copy lives in `src/lib/content/*` — not long hardcoded strings in components.

## 3D

- Scenes under `src/components/3d/*`.
- Canvas is decorative; headings, CTAs, forms stay real HTML.
- Lazy-load heavy 3D, cap DPR, static fallback, honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Interaction

- Hover-only is insufficient — provide keyboard focus and mobile tap/detail states.
- Use `components/timeline/*` for Yearly Journey and Recurring Activities timelines.

## After large edits

- Self-check: "Does this code have any breaks?"
- Run `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, and `npm run build` when appropriate.
